[ti:Auld Lang Syne]
[ar:Frank C. Stanley]
[al:Public domain demo]

[00:13.00]Should old acquaintance be forgot,
[00:20.10]and never brought to mind?
[00:24.60]Should old acquaintance be forgot,
[00:32.10]and days of auld lang syne?
[00:38.10]For auld lang syne, my dear,
[00:45.10]for auld lang syne,
[00:51.10]we'll take a cup of kindness yet,
[00:57.10]for auld lang syne.
[01:16.10]And there's a hand, my trusty friend!
[01:23.10]and give me a hand o' thine!
[01:29.10]We'll take a right good-will draught,
[01:35.10]for auld lang syne.
[01:41.10]For auld lang syne, my dear,
[01:48.10]for auld lang syne,
[01:55.10]We'll take a right good-will draught,
[02:01.10]for auld lang syne.
